Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:42:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/17] Lakeside camera r3 (Funning/reviewer on 0e39055): close
 fallback-like end pose + board lens, pitch 58 void; blend = one S for
 position/slerp/FOV

- landing: end pose = the default follow lens's final pose (6.8 m back / 1.76 m right / 3.0 m up, aim 60% toward her),
  arrival Hermite off (lens rides her S-curve walk; lens peak 3.02 m/s, |a| 1.95, |jerk| 4.87), height only settles (no crane-up)
- RegionJourneyCore: Landing key arrivalYawToHer (0 = unchanged for other routes)
- board (portrait): camera stays at the landing position; yaw/pitch + FOV solved so the 3D board centre sits on the 2D grid
  centre and the centre row matches its width (pitch ~10-14 deg, FOV 47-59 deg); landscape unchanged (75 deg / 40)
- lakesideLandingBlend: position lerp, view slerp, FOV lerp on the same smootherstep (lateralExp removed)
- test: K8 at 60 Hz (rest at both ends, monotonic/no overshoot, single-peak rates, per-frame series), K4 height <= 0.26,
  K6 tray inset asserted on landscape only (portrait reported)

(cherry picked from commit b0c21d245f88d3160f88a8a8ba9cdd5ac96f7072)
